  "body": "Built a Debian package that runs BitNet b1.58 2B4T as a systemd service on Ubuntu 24.04.\n\n**What it does:**\n- `sudo apt install bitnet-server` from PPA\n- OpenAI-compatible API on localhost:11435\n- Socket activation: 112KB idle, starts on first request\n- Auto-downloads model from HuggingFace\n- Sandboxed (unprivileged user, systemd protections)\n\n**PPA:** `ppa:satyajeet1827/bitnet-server`\n**Source:** https://github.com/123Satyajeet123/bitnet-server\n\nSharing in case it's useful for the community or worth linking from the README. Happy to answer questions about the packaging approach.",
